AB  - In this demo we showcase the innovative features of MONOLITH 2.0, the Semantic Knowledge Graph platform, which gives access to the Ontologybased Data Management (OBDM) capabilities of the MASTRO 2.0 ontology reasoner, in particular to its enhanced SPARQL query answering and data quality checking features, provides a user-friendly environment to build SQL-based mappings of structured enterprise data to the ontology, and allows to build Virtual Knowledge Graphs from this data, or from external RDF or tabular datasets. © 2021 CEUR-WS. All rights reserved.
