AB  - One of the tasks for semantic web is to integrate large amounts of data in current Deep Web data sources into machine-understandable RDF data model to form a "web of data". Currently, mediator/wrapper approach is commonly used in the RDF-based data integration to describe the data model of heterogeneous data sources as intermediate RDF model by RDF wrapper. This paper describes a wrapper of Deep Web data source uses RDF View. The wrapper supports the SPARQL-to-SQL query rewriting and wrapping the SQL query results as RDF data. © 2011 by Binary Information Press.
