AB  - The proceedings contain 13 papers. The topics discussed include: specifying ontology design patterns with an ontology repository; ontology design patterns in use - lessons learnt from an ontology engineering case; ontology design pattern language expressivity requirements; modest use of ontology design patterns in a repository of biomedical ontologies; a pattern for interrelated numerical properties; linguistic patterns for information extraction in OntoCmaps; conformance to standards; reactive processes; applications of ontology design patterns in the transformation of multimedia repositories; SPARQL-DL queries for antipattern detection; relational database to RDF mapping patterns; and building ontologies by using re-engineering patterns and R2RML mappings.
