AD  - Institute of Control and Information Engineering, Poznań University of Technology, Poland
AB  - We discuss the problem of creating a knowledge base representing a relational database exchange system and reasoning about schema mappings in such scenario. The knowledge base is developed by describing both databases and mappings in the data exchange system by means of OWL ontology. The key issue is to decide about preservation of semantics of data while the data are being transformed. Then some reasoning about consistency of schema mappings with integrity constraints of databases and with application domain knowledge is necessary. © 2012 The authors and IOS Press. All rights reserved.
